's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"5288bd04899d54c6d069ca33e6540991","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ec7d143cebd3af5425528666745f3268","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c4547e76ed1b8b468b947213cf6a21e4","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"f52ab391684be7cbf05bfa995bfaad43","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"337124c873cab0e44b0fc355c6f51cb9","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ab35243775bd48818542eb7ce2ff9d0b","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"b0a9b179d9b424857c37c57981c8dfa6","originalFileName":"8f9fad4c-ee56-47a4-a1d8-f422c877888d-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"74e326af